@ 1:9  eventmod|eling accTitle: Cart
  1:1-1:14 "eventmodeling"
  | **`eventmodeling`**
  |
  | An event model is `eventmodeling`, then statements: frames, `entity`, `data`, `note`, `gwt`, `title`, `accTitle` and `accDescr`. The `YAML`, `DIRECTIVE` and comment tokens of the lexer are skipped before parsing.
@ 1:18  eventmodeling acc|Title: Cart
  1:15-1:23 "accTitle"
  | **`accTitle`**
  |
  | `accTitle: …`: the accessible title.
@ 2:2  t|f 01 evt Added
  2:1-2:3 "tf"
  | **`tf`**
  |
  | `tf 01 evt Name` (or `timeframe`; `rf` or `resetframe` for a reset frame, to which no relation is inferred), then its sources (`->> 01`), a `[[data]]` reference and inline data, in that order, each optional.
@ 2:8  tf 01 e|vt Added
  2:7-2:10 "evt"
  | **`evt`**
  |
  | A frame's kind, which picks its lane: `ui` and `pcr` (`processor`) the UI/Automation lane, `cmd` (`command`) and `rmo` (`readmodel`) the Command/Read Model lane, `evt` (`event`) the Events lane.
