  3:1-3:3 "rf"
  | **`rf`**
  |
  | `tf 01 evt Name` (or `timeframe`; `rf` or `resetframe` for a reset frame, to which no relation is inferred), then its sources (`->> 01`), a `[[data]]` reference and inline data, in that order, each optional.
@ 3:16  rf 02 cmd Add -|>> 01 `json` { a: 1 }
  3:15-3:18 "->>"
  | **`->>`**
  |
  | `->> 01`: the frame this one takes its input from; a frame may name several. Without one, the frame is joined to the nearest earlier frame in another lane.
